      },
      "message": "fix(app): break a catalog-hint size tie by name, not file order\n\nThe tool law's catalog hint picks the entry nearest 6 mm, then the\nsmaller size. A full tie kept the first entry in catalog.json order, so\nthe router starter cutters of #3159 (\"Router ball nose 6 mm\" before\n\"BN-0600\") changed the ball-nose hint and turned the tool_gate suite red\non main. The lower name now wins a full tie; the hint is the same for\nany file order. Pinned by a_size_tie_picks_by_name_not_file_order.\n\nFixes #3170\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
